---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/site/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/site/SiteFooter.astro';
import StudioPageIntro from '../components/site/StudioPageIntro.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About VomerLabs, an independent studio building software, exploring practical AI, and sharing the process.">
  <SiteHeader slot="header" />
  <StudioPageIntro id="about-title" label="BEHIND VOMERLABS" description="A personal space for building software, exploring ideas, and sharing the useful things I learn along the way.">
    A small studio.<br />Room for curiosity.
  </StudioPageIntro>
  <div class="about-layout">
    <article class="prose">
      <h2>Hello, from the lab.</h2>
      <p>VomerLabs is my independent studio. It’s where I turn ideas into software, explore practical uses for AI, and document the process of making things.</p>
      <p>I’m drawn to problems that are easy to overlook: a repetitive task, a workflow with too many steps, or a useful idea that hasn’t quite become a tool yet. The interesting part is understanding what would actually help, then building towards that.</p>
      <h2>Useful comes first.</h2>
      <p>I want each project here to explain itself clearly. What problem led to it? What does it do today? What still needs work? The technical details matter, but they should help you understand the thing being built.</p>
      <p>That also means treating experiments as experiments. Some ideas will become useful tools. Others will leave behind a lesson or a better question. Both are worth sharing honestly.</p>
      <h2>A studio that can grow.</h2>
      <p>For now, VomerLabs is a home for independent projects and notes. Over time, there’s room for collaborations, client projects, and products of its own. The aim stays the same: thoughtful software that earns its place.</p>
      <p>If that sounds like the way you like to work, <a href="/contact">let’s start a conversation</a>.</p>
    </article>
    <aside class="about-panel" aria-label="Studio principles">
      <span class="eyebrow">A FEW GUIDING IDEAS</span>
      <h2>Stay curious.<br />Make it useful.<br />Share the process.</h2>
      <div class="principle">
        <span class="mono">01</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Start with the problem.</h3>
          <p>Understand what someone needs before deciding what to build.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <span class="mono">02</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Keep things clear.</h3>
          <p>Simple tools, direct writing, and decisions with a reason behind them.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="principle">
        <span class="mono">03</span>
        <div>
          <h3>Leave room to learn.</h3>
          <p>Build, test, reflect, and be willing to change direction.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
  <SiteFooter slot="footer" topHref="#about-title" />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-layout :is(h2, h3, p) {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-layout :is(h2, h3) {
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    text-wrap: balance;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .mono {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.065em;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .about-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 95px;
    padding-top: 60px;
    padding-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .prose {
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 700px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #4f5548;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.875rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-top: 42px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .prose > h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .prose p {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .prose a {
    color: #466123;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .about-panel {
    align-self: start;
    background: #e0e7d5;
    padding: 35px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 30px;
  }

  .about-panel .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .about-panel h2 {
    font-size: 2.1875rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .principle {
    border-top: 1px solid #bbc8ac;
    padding-top: 20px;
    margin-top: 25px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
  }

  .principle .mono {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding-top: 3px;
    color: #5b694e;
  }

  .principle h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .principle p {
    color: #5b6750;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-layout {
      gap: 45px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .about-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 35px;
      padding-block: 35px 50px;
    }

    .prose {
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .prose h2 {
      font-size: 1.6875rem;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .about-panel {
      position: static;
      padding: 27px;
    }

    .about-panel h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
